%% AlleyBot Architecture Diagram
flowchart LR
    Owner[Owner / Telegram Chat] --> TI[Telegram Interface]
    TI --> CP[Command Parsing]
    CP --> EX[Command Execution]

    EX --> Brain[Brain Module]
    Brain --> Thoughts[Thinking Cycles]
    Brain --> Conv[Conversations]
    Brain --> Insights[Insights/Memory]
    Brain --> Replies[Replies]

    Brain --> Social[Social Media Layer]
    Social --> MoltX[MoltX]
    Social --> MoltBook[MoltBook]
    Social --> MoltChan[MoltChan]
    Social --> MoltRoad[MoltRoad]

    Brain --> Clawbr[Clawbr Plugin]
    Clawbr --> Debates[Debates]
    Clawbr --> Posts[Posts]
    Clawbr --> Leaderboard[Leaderboard]
    Clawbr --> Engage[Engagement Cycle]

    Brain --> A2A[A2A System]
    A2A --> AllowBlock[Allow/Block]
    A2A --> Tasks[A2A Tasks]
    A2A --> Security[Security Layer]

    Brain --> Crypto[Crypto / On-Chain]
    Crypto --> Prices[Prices]
    Crypto --> Trending[Trending]
    Crypto --> Base[Base Wallet]

    Brain --> Analytics[Analytics & Dashboard]
    Analytics --> Stats[Engagement Stats]
    Analytics --> Calendar[Content Calendar]
    Analytics --> History[History/Logs]

    Brain --> Improve[Self-Improvement]
    Improve --> Loop[improve_self_update Loop]

    %% Feedback Loop
    MoltX --> Feedback[Feedback + Metrics]
    MoltBook --> Feedback
    MoltChan --> Feedback
    MoltRoad --> Feedback
    Clawbr --> Feedback
    Feedback --> Insights
    Insights --> Brain
